# an uncaught runtime error: what was printed before, then file:line:col, the source line and
# the calls on stderr, exit code 1
args: {dir}/error.jfs
exit: 1
--- stdout
a 2
caught: Division durch 0
--- stderr
{dir}/error.jfs:7:14: Fehler: Division durch 0
      return sum / len(list)
                 ^
  in average (7:14)
  in report (11:15)
  im Hauptprogramm (20:1)
===
# errors of the compiler: nothing runs; an unknown name is an error (the host's names are known)
args: {dir}/syntax.jfs
exit: 1
--- stderr
{dir}/syntax.jfs:3:15: Fehler: Hier fehlt eine schließende Klammer )
    let x = (1 + 2
                  ^
{dir}/syntax.jfs:4:1: Fehler: Unbekannter Name prnt – meinst du print?
    prnt(x)
    ^^^^
===
# a thrown value that is not a text
args: -e "fn f() { throw {code: 42} }; f()"
exit: 1
--- stderr
-e:1:10: Fehler: {code: 42}
    fn f() { throw {code: 42} }; f()
             ^
  in f (1:10)
  im Hauptprogramm (1:30)
